      "updated": 1787048533732,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Must Read --> Very Important\nSecurity Perspective - In that sense\n\nWe are saying we are going to put\nWorker Nodes in both private or public subnet \n\nBut I intentionally set it this way \njust to realize worker node shouldn't really have public access",
      "fontSize": 23.911176194133645,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Must Read --> Very Important\nSecurity Perspective - In that sense\n\nWe are saying we are going to put\nWorker Nodes in both private or public subnet \n\nBut I intentionally set it this way \njust to realize worker node shouldn't really have public access",
