    {
      "id": "MkGBigv2F575GcKxXwnmv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16587.79658906595,
      "y": 51.12399623933197,
      "width": 2234.671875,
      "height": 762.868829541947,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "9O5u2x5IFDr2P_iPWB-lF",
      "index": "bEA2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 729011623,
      "version": 850,
      "versionNonce": 1771698759,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787120284764,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "EKS Access Authentication \n\nWhen we think of EKS AuthN & AuthZ, there will be \nperspective of both AWS & K8s , \n\nLet's think of like this\nWhen you think to authenticate to destination k8s , at least, \nthere is two steps,\n--> 1. We need to authenticate to aws first\n    --> AuthZ --> we will know which resources we are to access\n--> 2. We need to authenticate to k8s first\n    --> Based on role and rolebindings, we will have access to resources",
      "fontSize": 52.977002051524096,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "EKS Access Authentication \n\nWhen we think of EKS AuthN & AuthZ, there will be \nperspective of both AWS & K8s , \n\nLet's think of like this\nWhen you think to authenticate to destination k8s , at least, \nthere is two steps,\n--> 1. We need to authenticate to aws first\n    --> AuthZ --> we will know which resources we are to access\n--> 2. We need to authenticate to k8s first\n    --> Based on role and rolebindings, we will have access to resources",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sHjg_S0m4qbt9jljITtH-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16796.338517284963,
      "y": 2456.238304715793,
      "width": 590.712890625,
      "height": 146.6536113592678,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#846358",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
