      "text": "NOTE: These are sets of permission defined by AWS by default. If you want to adjust the permission then,\nYou have to understand k8s role,rolebindings,clusterrole,clusterrolebindings,service account\n\nThis is another story of k8s. You can check repository below to see my detailed analysis.",
